Make Scenes a higher class object, add a Scenes page, below Lights and above Floor Plan. Add some more defaults, like Hue.

Hue lights are not getting a color wheel. Lets make sure we're polling the Hue API correctly, `references/hue_api_reference.pdf` is a downloaded pdf of the login-locked hue API reference.

LED corning seems to only bend on the center of a tile. when it then transitions to another "wall", it appears on the "far" side of the wall. (like went through the wall ) if that makes sense. I'd like for it to be able to visually represent, for example, the strip running along the inner trim of a hallway.

Rooms should be buttons (much like lights), with an on/off toggle (not buttons). Lets also make the scene creator a lot cleaner.

