### 8 API for other apps

- API should be documented properly in the repo. 
 - we generate client API keys, no rbac just full access to lights and rooms.

We expose Bifrost-abstracted "rooms" only (not provider groups), and individual lights.

Everything we can do in the UI should be available through the API - including scene support.

The Floor Plan is not available through API.


